# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:12
translate italian suzy0_b52dca5a:

    # "I go to the kitchen and make a plate with what's left, then sit down across from her at the table."
    "Vado in cucina e mi preparo un piatto con quello che è rimasto, poi mi siedo a tavola di fronte a lei."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:13
translate italian suzy0_a9d96a39:

    # "She doesn't even look up at me as she casually eats, not really even paying attention to the fact that I'm there."
    "Non mi guarda nemmeno mentre mangia con disinvoltura, senza prestare davvero attenzione al fatto che io sia lì."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:16
translate italian breakfastmenu_752743ef:

    # pc "So how have you been doing?"
    pc "Allora, come te la cavi?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:18
translate italian breakfastmenu_7a0e54f8:

    # "She raises her eyes towards me, looking slightly annoyed by my question."
    "Alza lo sguardo verso di me, sembrando leggermente infastidita dalla mia domanda."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:19
translate italian breakfastmenu_19dcc455:

    # ss "I've been fine."
    ss "Sto bene."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:20
translate italian breakfastmenu_ed75df6c:

    # pc "School going okay?"
    pc "A scuola va tutto bene?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:21
translate italian breakfastmenu_95991dd2:

    # ss "We've barely started the semester. I don't know how it's going."
    ss "Abbiamo appena iniziato il semestre. Non so come stia andando."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:22
translate italian breakfastmenu_6150338d:

    # pc "And work? You work at Java Lava, right?"
    pc "E il lavoro? Lavori al Java Lava, giusto?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:24
translate italian breakfastmenu_13de2504:

    # "She turns her phone off and slides it into her pocket, then really looks up at me for the first time."
    "Spegne il telefono e lo infila in tasca, poi mi guarda davvero per la prima volta."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:25
translate italian breakfastmenu_ae5be968:

    # ss "Yeah. It's fine. It's not too hard and I get paid."
    ss "Sì. Va bene. Non è troppo difficile e mi pagano."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:29
translate italian breakfastmenu_e05d2344:

    # ss "Oh man, you wouldn't believe the guys we get in there."
    ss "Oh cavolo, non crederesti mai ai tipi che ci capitano lì dentro."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:30
translate italian breakfastmenu_322cf28b:

    # pc "Who's your weirdest."
    pc "Chi è il più strano?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:31
translate italian breakfastmenu_cd997a04:

    # ss "So there was this one guy who comes in all the time. I don't even remember his name; we just call him kombucha guy."
    ss "C’era questo tizio che veniva sempre. Non ricordo nemmeno il suo nome; lo chiamiamo semplicemente “il tizio del kombucha”."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:32
translate italian breakfastmenu_be9a8d1f:

    # ss "We serve kombucha tea there, but it rarely gets ordered. But this guy comes in almost every day, at least four times a week, and buys two kombucha teas."
    ss "Lì serviamo il tè kombucha, ma lo ordinano raramente. Ma questo tizio viene quasi ogni giorno, almeno quattro volte a settimana, e compra due tè kombucha."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:33
translate italian breakfastmenu_23ceb711:

    # ss "He sits at a table by himself and stares out the window and drinks both of those teas back to back, then leaves a two-dollar tip and leaves."
    ss "Si siede da solo a un tavolo, fissa fuori dalla finestra e beve entrambe le tazze di tè una dopo l’altra, poi lascia una mancia di due dollari e se ne va."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:34
translate italian breakfastmenu_f53e358e:

    # pc "Weird. Have you ever talked to him?"
    pc "Strano. Gli hai mai parlato?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:35
translate italian breakfastmenu_0ef624f4:

    # ss "Oh yeah. He's a little crazy. He says that he's some kind of musician and he tried to get Tammy to go out with him. He told her that he's really famous over in Japan."
    ss "Oh sì. È un po’ fuori di testa. Dice di essere una specie di musicista e ha cercato di convincere Tammy a uscire con lui. Le ha detto che in Giappone è davvero famoso."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:36
translate italian breakfastmenu_d22ad849:

    # ss "Then he went on and on about how Japan is way better than here. How they have holographic baristas that make your coffee and bring it to your table."
    ss "Poi ha continuato a ripetere che il Giappone è molto meglio di qui. Che lì ci sono baristi olografici che preparano il caffè e te lo portano al tavolo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:37
translate italian breakfastmenu_fa3e4e10:

    # ss "How he bought a phone there five years ago for $20 and doesn't have to pay a monthly fee because it runs off a satellite."
    ss "Che cinque anni fa ha comprato un telefono lì per 20 dollari e non deve pagare alcun canone mensile perché funziona via satellite."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:38
translate italian breakfastmenu_ce59dba2:

    # pc "Wow."
    pc "Wow."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:39
translate italian breakfastmenu_faaa2ecb:

    # ss "He's always hitting on Tammy every time he comes in. She likes to mess with him too."
    ss "Ci prova sempre con Tammy ogni volta che entra. Anche a lei piace stuzzicarlo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:40
translate italian breakfastmenu_9e19cf64:

    # ss "He came in one time and was telling her about how he invented this new clock that was small, and you could carry it around with you."
    ss "Una volta è entrato e le stava raccontando di aver inventato questo nuovo orologio che era piccolo e che si poteva portare con sé."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:41
translate italian breakfastmenu_5d1c5ae8:

    # pc "Isn't that just a watch?"
    pc "Ma non è semplicemente un orologio da polso?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:42
translate italian breakfastmenu_c152b77b:

    # ss "That's what Tammy said. He argued with her and told her it was completely different."
    ss "È quello che ha detto Tammy. Lui ha discusso con lei e le ha detto che era completamente diverso."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:43
translate italian breakfastmenu_3791927f:

    # ss "So the next day she told him about how she had invented this new type of pastries that had fruit filling and were sold in individual packages and would fit perfectly in your toaster."
    ss "Così il giorno dopo lei gli ha raccontato di aver inventato un nuovo tipo di pasticcini con ripieno di frutta, venduti in confezioni singole e che entravano perfettamente nel tostapane."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:44
translate italian breakfastmenu_74618d28:

    # pc "Pop Tarts?"
    pc "I Pop Tarts?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:45
translate italian breakfastmenu_c72adb9b:

    # ss "Yeah, but he'd apparently never heard of them, because he went on and on about how it was an amazing idea and how he wanted to pay her to buy that idea from her so he could make it."
    ss "Sì, ma a quanto pare lui non ne aveva mai sentito parlare, perché continuava a ripetere che era un’idea fantastica e che voleva pagarla per comprarle quell’idea in modo da poterla realizzare."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:46
translate italian breakfastmenu_e8b6bb21:

    # pc "Did she take his money?"
    pc "Ha preso i suoi soldi?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:47
translate italian breakfastmenu_75e09394:

    # ss "Fifty bucks."
    ss "Cinquanta dollari."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:48
translate italian breakfastmenu_5cbde015:

    # pc "That's fucked up!"
    pc "È assurdo!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:50
translate italian breakfastmenu_5f99478a:

    # ss "I know right?"
    ss "Lo so, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:51
translate italian breakfastmenu_c085fd14:

    # "She starts laughing, and I can't help but to laugh too."
    "Lei inizia a ridere, e non posso fare a meno di ridere anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:55
translate italian breakfastmenu_74c7877c:

    # ss "Yeah, I don't do that stuff. I kind of feel bad for him."
    ss "Sì, io non faccio quelle cose. In un certo senso mi dispiace per lui."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:56
translate italian breakfastmenu_d31a7dfa:

    # ss "He seems like he's not playing with a full deck, you know? I figure he's probably had a rough life."
    ss "Sembra che non abbia tutte le rotelle a posto, capisci? Immagino che probabilmente abbia avuto una vita difficile."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:57
translate italian breakfastmenu_9ccec7b2:

    # ss "But Tammy is just like that."
    ss "Ma Tammy è fatta così."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:58
translate italian breakfastmenu_e0586b57:

    # ss "She can take care of herself though. She does MMA, you know? Fights in a ring and everything."
    ss "Sa cavarsela da sola, però. Pratica le MMA, sai? Combatte sul ring e tutto il resto."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:59
translate italian breakfastmenu_399bdc0f:

    # pc "Really?"
    pc "Davvero?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:60
translate italian breakfastmenu_02b90fe6:

    # ss "Yeah. She's good too. I've gone and watched her fight before. She can seriously kick some ass."
    ss "Sì. Ed è anche brava. Sono andato a vederla combattere una volta. Sa davvero dare una bella lezione a qualcuno."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:61
translate italian breakfastmenu_1189f258:

    # pc "You never wanted to get into it though?"
    pc "Non hai mai voluto provarci, però?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:62
translate italian breakfastmenu_a7e15ac4:

    # ss "Nah. It's too much work for me, and I really don't want to get hit."
    ss "No. È troppo faticoso per me, e non ho proprio voglia di prendere botte."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:65
translate italian breakfastmenu_9f26e184:

    # ss "Aw, thanks, [bro]. I'm glad you don't want me to get beat up."
    ss "Oh, grazie, [bro]. Sono contenta che tu non voglia che mi prendano a botte."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:66
translate italian breakfastmenu_3090c620:

    # pc "If I saw somebody hitting you, even in a ring, even if it was a girl, I'd have to kick their ass. It's in the big [brother] rulebook."
    pc "Se vedessi qualcuno che ti picchia, anche sul ring, anche se fosse una ragazza, dovrei fargli il culo. È nel grande [brother] regolamento."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:68
translate italian breakfastmenu_caad0343:

    # "She burst into laughter."
    "Lei scoppiò a ridere."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:69
translate italian breakfastmenu_0cfa18a1:

    # ss "I don't think you could even take these girls. Tammy would wipe the floor with you."
    ss "Non credo che riusciresti nemmeno a battere queste ragazze. Tammy ti farebbe il culo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:70
translate italian breakfastmenu_ae871f39:

    # pc "Oh yeah?"
    pc "Ah sì?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:72
translate italian breakfastmenu_4122a41e:

    # ss "Yeah, definitely."
    ss "Sì, senza dubbio."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:73
translate italian breakfastmenu_2d87f285:

    # pc "Well I'd get my ass kicked so you didn't have to then."
    pc "Beh, allora mi farei prendere a calci in culo io, così non dovresti farlo tu."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:74
translate italian breakfastmenu_906493b5:

    # ss "Really? You'd get your ass kicked for me?"
    ss "Davvero? Ti faresti prendere a calci in culo per me?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:77
translate italian breakfastmenu_d120684f:

    # ss "I don't believe you."
    ss "Non ti credo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:79
translate italian breakfastmenu_9f7e6e8a:

    # ss "See, I knew it!"
    ss "Vedi, lo sapevo!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:82
translate italian breakfastmenu_934dd153:

    # ss "Anger? What anger? I'm not angry at anybody."
    ss "Rabbia? Quale rabbia? Non sono arrabbiato con nessuno."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:83
translate italian breakfastmenu_b287d4be:

    # pc "You seem angry at me."
    pc "Sembri arrabbiato con me."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:84
translate italian breakfastmenu_87014878:

    # ss "Well, if you were in the ring with me, yeah, I could channel that anger into an ass kicking."
    ss "Beh, se fossi sul ring con me, sì, potrei incanalare quella rabbia in una bella batosta."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:85
translate italian breakfastmenu_e7037ffa:

    # pc "I don't know. I think I could take you."
    pc "Non lo so. Penso che potrei batterti."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:87
translate italian breakfastmenu_a43ee1a8:

    # ss "Not as often as they do Tammy, but I get one or two a day."
    ss "Non così spesso come fanno con Tammy, ma ne ricevo uno o due al giorno."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:88
translate italian breakfastmenu_046a9753:

    # ss "I've gone on dates with a few of the guys that I've met there, but nothing really panned out."
    ss "Sono uscita con alcuni dei ragazzi che ho conosciuto lì, ma non è successo niente di serio."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:89
translate italian breakfastmenu_b102ceb1:

    # pc "Nobody harassing you though?"
    pc "Ma nessuno ti molesta, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:90
translate italian breakfastmenu_f72e097b:

    # ss "Nah, not really."
    ss "No, non proprio."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:91
translate italian breakfastmenu_0ac94505:

    # pc "Good. I'd hate to have to bust some heads."
    pc "Bene. Non vorrei dover spaccare qualche testa."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:93
translate italian breakfastmenu_35df88eb:

    # ss "Bust heads? You? Don't make me laugh."
    ss "Spaccare teste? Tu? Non farmi ridere."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:94
translate italian breakfastmenu_4d303faa:

    # pc "Hey! I could do it."
    pc "Ehi! Potrei farlo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:98
translate italian breakfastmenu_a79bfefa:

    # ss "Really? You're going to ask me how much I make. That's none of your damn business."
    ss "Davvero? Stai per chiedermi quanto guadagno. Non sono affari tuoi, cavolo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:99
translate italian breakfastmenu_02a4aa53:

    # pc "Sorry, I was just making conversation."
    pc "Scusa, stavo solo facendo conversazione."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:101
translate italian breakfastmenu_e2bc9fa0:

    # ss "Well, make it with somebody else. I'm not interested in talking to you."
    ss "Beh, parlane con qualcun altro. Non mi interessa parlare con te."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:102
translate italian breakfastmenu_b57d2eab:

    # "Before I can apologize, she stands up and walks out of the room."
    "Prima che io possa scusarmi, lei si alza e esce dalla stanza."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:103
translate italian breakfastmenu_d8f00519:

    # "I guess I'll have to try to fix things with her some other day."
    "Immagino che dovrò provare a sistemare le cose con lei un altro giorno."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:104
translate italian breakfastmenu_c0aeac6d:

    # "I finish eating by myself and then clean off the table and get ready to go to school."
    "Finisco di mangiare da solo, poi sparecchio il tavolo e mi preparo per andare a scuola."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:108
translate italian breakfastmenu_1b55d4a6:

    # ss "That doesn't really surprise me. You would suck at it."
    ss "Non mi sorprende affatto. Saresti un disastro."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:109
translate italian breakfastmenu_142311fd:

    # ss "You're not good at talking to people. You just whine and get on everybody's nerves."
    ss "Non sei bravo a parlare con le persone. Non fai altro che lamentarti e dare sui nervi a tutti."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:112
translate italian breakfastmenu_d1097009:

    # ss "I think you whine too much and pity yourself, yes."
    ss "Penso che ti lamenti troppo e ti autocommiseri, sì."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:113
translate italian breakfastmenu_a8b0992c:

    # pc "I'm really not like that though. You don't really even know me."
    pc "In realtà non sono affatto così. Tu non mi conosci nemmeno."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:115
translate italian breakfastmenu_952b2153:

    # ss "Sure you are. You whine and you pity yourself."
    ss "Certo che lo sei. Ti lamenti e ti autocommiseri."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:116
translate italian breakfastmenu_fbb5736d:

    # pc "You don't really even know me."
    pc "Tu non mi conosci nemmeno."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:118
translate italian breakfastmenu_db9ad157:

    # ss "Better than you. All you do is whine and pity yourself."
    ss "Meglio di te. Non fai altro che lamentarti e autocommiserarti."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:119
translate italian breakfastmenu_c4de7a83:

    # pc "What are you talking about. You barely even know me."
    pc "Di cosa stai parlando? Mi conosci a malapena."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:120
translate italian breakfastmenu_9965969f:

    # ss "You never gave me the chance to get to know you. When we started getting used to each other and getting along, you just up and left."
    ss "Non mi hai mai dato la possibilità di conoscerti. Quando stavamo iniziando ad abituarci l’uno all’altro e ad andare d’accordo, te ne sei andato senza preavviso."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:121
translate italian breakfastmenu_9ef2ee78:

    # pc "I'm not going to leave this time. I'm going to stay here and help out."
    pc "Questa volta non me ne andrò. Resterò qui ad aiutarti."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:124
translate italian breakfastmenu_c0dc7bfc:

    # ss "I don't see how that's any of your business, but yes. His name is Tim and he lives in Whiterock."
    ss "Non vedo come possa essere affar tuo, ma sì. Si chiama Tim e vive a Whiterock."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:125
translate italian breakfastmenu_130cbb47:

    # pc "How's the long-distance thing working out?"
    pc "Come sta andando la storia a distanza?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:127
translate italian breakfastmenu_2c9e2c8d:

    # ss "I'm not going to talk to you about my relationships."
    ss "Non ho intenzione di parlarti delle mie relazioni."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:128
translate italian breakfastmenu_1422ef63:

    # pc "Why not? What's a big [brother] for, if not for giving advice?"
    pc "Perché no? A cosa serve un grande [brother], se non a dare consigli?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:129
translate italian breakfastmenu_372edb07:

    # ss "In my experience, a big [brother] is only there to be annoying and then abandon you."
    ss "Secondo la mia esperienza, un grande [brother] serve solo a darti fastidio e poi ad abbandonarti."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:130
translate italian breakfastmenu_620cccdd:

    # pc "I didn't abandon you Suzy. I went to college."
    pc "Non ti ho abbandonata, Suzy. Sono andato all’università."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:131
translate italian breakfastmenu_43e8a5ea:

    # ss "Same difference. You could have written or called or something."
    ss "È la stessa cosa. Avresti potuto scrivermi o chiamarmi o qualcosa del genere."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:132
translate italian breakfastmenu_cdfa161d:

    # pc "Well I'm here now. I'm not going to leave again. I'm going to stay and help."
    pc "Beh, ora sono qui. Non me ne andrò più. Resterò e ti aiuterò."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:135
translate italian breakfastmenu_db8d354f:

    # ss "I have no idea. Rumor is that he found another woman and disappeared with her."
    ss "Non ne ho idea. Si dice che abbia trovato un’altra donna e sia sparito con lei."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:136
translate italian breakfastmenu_4183655a:

    # pc "Where are you hearing these rumors?"
    pc "Dove senti queste voci?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:137
translate italian breakfastmenu_6f70f528:

    # ss "Just around town."
    ss "In giro per la città."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:138
translate italian breakfastmenu_adc582ed:

    # pc "Do you think there's any truth to it? Did you ever see him with anybody?"
    pc "Pensi che ci sia del vero? L’hai mai visto con qualcuno?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:140
translate italian breakfastmenu_c058de0d:

    # ss "He was so secretive about everything. He stayed in the basement all the time and barely talked to us in the weeks before he disappeared."
    ss "Era così riservato su tutto. Stava sempre in cantina e ci parlava a malapena nelle settimane prima di sparire."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:141
translate italian breakfastmenu_0c233c3e:

    # ss "So no, I never saw him with anybody, because I barely saw him at all."
    ss "Quindi no, non l’ho mai visto con nessuno, perché lo vedevo a malapena."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:143
translate italian breakfastmenu_b8c6a91b:

    # ss "I don't know if he left with somebody else, but I wouldn't be surprised. I mean, what else could it be?"
    ss "Non so se se ne sia andato con qualcun’altra, ma non mi sorprenderebbe. Voglio dire, cos’altro potrebbe essere?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:144
translate italian breakfastmenu_584eeb38:

    # pc "I'm sorry that you had to deal with this all alone."
    pc "Mi dispiace che tu abbia dovuto affrontare tutto questo da sola."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:145
translate italian breakfastmenu_61d6e76f:

    # pc "But I'm here to help now."
    pc "Ma ora sono qui per aiutarti."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:149
translate italian breakfastmenu_fcfa5eb9:

    # ss "Are you fucking serious?"
    ss "Ma stai scherzando, cazzo?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:150
translate italian breakfastmenu_448a6b89:

    # ss "It's my bathroom. Not your bathroom. Not our bathroom. MY bathroom!"
    ss "È il mio bagno. Non il tuo bagno. Non il nostro bagno. Il MIO bagno!"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:151
translate italian breakfastmenu_558e1795:

    # ss "If you don't like it, you can just get the fuck out."
    ss "Se non ti sta bene, puoi andartene a fanculo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:152
translate italian breakfastmenu_e861901c:

    # pc "We're going to have to learn to share."
    pc "Dovremo imparare a condividere."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:153
translate italian breakfastmenu_5b696ff4:

    # ss "No we're not. You're going to have to learn that it's my space and you can go fuck yourself."
    ss "No, non dovremo. Dovrai imparare che questo è il mio spazio e che puoi andare a farti fottere."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:154
translate italian breakfastmenu_2c586b30:

    # pc "What's the use of us being mad at each other all the time?"
    pc "Che senso ha stare sempre arrabbiati l’uno con l’altro?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:155
translate italian breakfastmenu_86802cd2:

    # ss "Leave me alone. I don't want to talk to you, I'm just trying to eat breakfast here."
    ss "Lasciami in pace. Non voglio parlarti, sto solo cercando di fare colazione."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:156
translate italian breakfastmenu_15190116:

    # pc "Fine."
    pc "Va bene."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:163
translate italian suzyreconcile_a9b7d881:

    # ss "You talk a big game, but when it comes down to it, you'll run away."
    ss "Fai il duro, ma quando si arriva al dunque, scapperai via."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:164
translate italian suzyreconcile_e9414b02:

    # ss "Just like you ran away to Brazil."
    ss "Proprio come sei scappato in Brasile."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:165
translate italian suzyreconcile_5d857346:

    # pc "I didn't run away. I got a scholarship. It was the best college for my field."
    pc "Non sono scappato. Ho ottenuto una borsa di studio. Era il miglior college per il mio campo di studi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:166
translate italian suzyreconcile_e67211ab:

    # ss "We were just starting to get along. I was actually starting to enjoy having you around. My big [brother]."
    ss "Stavamo appena iniziando ad andare d’accordo. In realtà stavo iniziando a godermi la tua compagnia. Il mio grande [brother]."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:167
translate italian suzyreconcile_1ddfbed6:

    # ss "Then you just leave and don't even call me, e-mail me, nothing."
    ss "Poi te ne sei semplicemente andato senza nemmeno chiamarmi, mandarmi un’e-mail, niente."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:168
translate italian suzyreconcile_6e56d9fd:

    # ss "You just leave. It felt like you wanted to get as far away from us as possible."
    ss "Te ne sei semplicemente andato. Sembrava che volessi allontanarti il più possibile da noi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:169
translate italian suzyreconcile_65a60962:

    # pc "That wasn't it."
    pc "Non era così."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:171
translate italian suzyreconcile_304ad7a9:

    # ss "Don't lie. I can tell when you're lying."
    ss "Non mentire. Mi accorgo quando menti."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:172
translate italian suzyreconcile_63428b62:

    # pc "Okay, maybe I did want to get away a bit. But it wasn't about you or Lisa. It was just that I missed my mom and didn't like to see her replaced."
    pc "Ok, forse volevo davvero allontanarmi un po'. Ma non aveva nulla a che fare con te o con Lisa. È solo che mi mancava mia madre e non mi piaceva vedere che qualcuno prendesse il suo posto."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:173
translate italian suzyreconcile_238de080:

    # pc "I see now that I was childish then. That you weren't replacing her."
    pc "Ora capisco che allora mi sono comportata da bambina. Che tu non stavi prendendo il suo posto."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:174
translate italian suzyreconcile_e4ed90e5:

    # pc "I'm sorry. I'll do better now."
    pc "Mi dispiace. D'ora in poi mi comporterò meglio."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:175
translate italian suzyreconcile_6e67a0a4:

    # pc "I want us to be friends."
    pc "Voglio che restiamo amiche."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:177
translate italian suzyreconcile_9a7d3359:

    # pc "I care about you Suzy. I really do."
    pc "Ci tengo a te, Suzy. Davvero."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:178
translate italian suzyreconcile_bf55225d:

    # ss "I care about you too, I guess."
    ss "Anch'io ci tengo a te, credo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:179
translate italian suzyreconcile_02d6656a:

    # pc "So can we put all that junk behind us."
    pc "Allora possiamo lasciarci tutta quella storia alle spalle?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:180
translate italian suzyreconcile_0ad83f38:

    # ss "Yeah. Let's do that. Let's start over."
    ss "Sì. Facciamolo. Ricominciamo da capo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:181
translate italian suzyreconcile_af3bb346:

    # pc "Great. Love you, [sis]. Glad we had this talk."
    pc "Fantastico. Ti voglio bene, [sis]. Sono contenta che abbiamo parlato."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:182
translate italian suzyreconcile_9e6f116f:

    # ss "Do you want to hug or something?"
    ss "Ti va di abbracciarci o qualcosa del genere?"

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:183
translate italian suzyreconcile_67aa3ee7:

    # pc "Yeah, let's do that."
    pc "Sì, facciamolo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:186
translate italian suzyreconcile_c6b79ddd:

    # "We stand up and walk over towards each other. It is awkward at first, but after I wrap my arms around her and pull her close, we both relax."
    "Ci alziamo e ci avviciniamo l’uno all’altra. All’inizio è un po’ imbarazzante, ma dopo che la stringo tra le braccia e la avvicino a me, ci rilassiamo entrambi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:187
translate italian suzyreconcile_e43a87e0:

    # "It feels right. I really do care about her and I feel like we can have a real relationship now."
    "Sembra la cosa giusta da fare. Ci tengo davvero a lei e sento che ora possiamo avere una relazione vera."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:188
translate italian suzyreconcile_710152a6:

    # ss "I love you too [bro]. I'm glad you're back home."
    ss "Ti voglio bene anch’io [bro]. Sono felice che tu sia tornata a casa."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:190
translate italian suzyreconcile_7264edb7:

    # "With that, it's time to go to school, so we say our goodbyes and I head out."
    "Detto questo, è ora di andare a scuola, quindi ci salutiamo e io esco."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:194
translate italian suzynoreconcile_68750ffa:

    # "We sit in silence until eventually Suzy gets up and stomps away upstairs."
    "Restiamo seduti in silenzio finché, alla fine, Suzy si alza e se ne va al piano di sopra sbattendo i piedi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:196
translate italian suzynoreconcile_b9fe82ed:

    # "This hadn't gone as well as I'd hoped. I guess I'll have to try to talk to her some other time."
    "Non è andata bene come speravo. Immagino che dovrò provare a parlarle un’altra volta."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:197
translate italian suzynoreconcile_db1e9d34:

    # "Right now though, it's time for school, so I clean up my dishes and head out."
    "Adesso, però, è ora di andare a scuola, quindi lavo i piatti e esco."

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:2
    old "Suzy eats breakfast in the dining room every weekday morning before school."
    new "Suzy fa colazione in sala da pranzo ogni mattina nei giorni feriali prima di andare a scuola."

    # game/Scenes/Suzy/suzy0.rpy:3
